pkg:Evidence_v1_45_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.45.0 (STORY-10 re-investigated: owner challenge tested for real)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: owner correctly challenged the prior 'no live LLM here' disclosure -- tested it directly rather than defending it. Confirmed a real WebGPU adapter exists (the implicit prior assumption was itself untested and wrong); found the page's default model fails with a real, specific ShaderF16SupportError; found a real non-f16 catalogue alternative, got 82% through a real download before a second real, distinct QuotaExceededError; tested http:// vs file:// origin to rule out a storage-policy artifact (quota near-identical, ruled out); searched the full real model catalogue and found no chat-capable model fits both constraints. Conclusion is now evidence-based, not assumed, with two independently diagnosed real reasons. Disclosed the owner's actual proposed alternative (external, user-supplied LLM endpoint) as genuinely untested here (no credential available) rather than treating the investigation as closed. Re-verified: pipeline order PASS, register CONFORMANT (0 violations)."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "8691368e0145a2e9d40fc63ae3459c35f7878c049e061ffe06d0f9c61eb08eb3"^^xsd:string .
